WEBVTT

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.641
I'm not so fundamentally enthusiastic

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.382
Even I will participate in this

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.153
It's been a long time since we went for a drive

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.417
Everyone is excited

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.287
He's coming too

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.822
I may have no chance with him right now

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.563
But I'm definitely going

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:38.603
If you've got a good poker face

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.741
There will be something

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.812
Let's head to the mountains

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.781
We'll just get sunburned at the sea

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.920
Even though it's coat season

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.357
He is completely misunderstanding

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.595
What's going on?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.566
Being this happy

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:14.439
I'm laughing so hard I might burst

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:22.982
I get choked up when I see his back

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:30.889
In the whirlpool of an endless smile

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:43.895
Mireille?

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:46.502
Mireille?

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.266
Mireille!

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.838
Mireille...

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.278
Mireille...

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.075
Wake up, Mireille.

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.608
Mireille, can you hear me?

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.920
Mire... Mireille...

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.046
Anna...

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.087
Anna...

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.961
Mireille!

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.930
Oh, thank goodness, Mireille!

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:17.592
I... I'm scared, Anna.

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:24.637
It's okay, Mireille. You're gonna be
fine because I'm here with you.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:29.180
You get well soon so we can go to the beach.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.916
Let's go to an amusement park together too.

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:35.047
Yeah...

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:40.123
Episode #15
Sorrow and Anger...

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.287
Are you trying to call Herve?

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.200
Yeah...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.836
If you chase him around like crazy,
he's gonna start calling you

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.565
only when it's convenient for him.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.562
That's how men are.

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:56.101
Yeah...

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:58.845
Sheedy quit.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:02:59.712
What?

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.014
So he was here?

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:04.074
Yeah, but he just quit out of the
blue about a month ago.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.980
And after I hired him because someone
I know asked me to!

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:12.725
Randy?

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:13.927
Is this Claire?

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.995
I finally got through to you!

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.797
Hey, what have you been doing?
Are you all right?

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:20.166
Yeah, I just came back to the
country this morning.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.031
Eh, we're managing. It's okay.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:25.327
Can I see you right now? I'm actually
right in front of your office.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:30.999
Well, then just meet me at the cafe in front of the
building. I don't have a whole lot of time.

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:40.753
Coffee...

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:42.322
Sorry, things are kind of crazy right now.

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:43.656
It's okay.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.089
Are you sure you're okay?

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:49.462
Some people are making a big deal
out of it, but seriously, it's okay.

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:52.265
Really? You'd better not hide anything
from your own sister!

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:56.903
It's just that I was unable to get a hold of my
purchasing agent for a little while,

00:03:56.903 --> 00:04:00.406
but it looks like the issue is going to be taken
care of sometime today, so it'll be just fine.

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:04.777
What? But the truth is that this
is no small problem, right?

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:06.713
Man, you're a worrywart, aren't you?

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.806
What can you do by worrying about it anyway?

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.116
Because...

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:11.481
Thank you for waiting.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.459
I went to your office just the other day,
but it was total chaos in there!

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:20.393
Anyway, for now I'm going to ask my investors
for temporary funding, and if that goes well,
I went to your office just the other day,
but it was total chaos in there!

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.095
Anyway, for now I'm going to ask my investors
for temporary funding, and if that goes well,

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:25.895
we should be able to make it to the
opening with no problems!

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:27.865
Randy...

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:29.969
Oh, don't give me that look!

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:32.538
If it ever comes down to it, I can just go ask
Dad's help and he'll bail me out!

00:04:32.538 --> 00:04:36.175
Are you still saying stuff like that?!
You can't just rely on him!

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:39.679
Dad isn't as bad as you think.

00:04:39.679 --> 00:04:43.479
Are you being serious?! He abandoned Mom!

00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:47.013
That was an accident, Claire,
and you already know that too!

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:48.784
That's not...

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:53.786
Yeah, it's me. Yeah...

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:57.389
What? Okay, I'll be right there.

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.332
Sorry, I gotta go.

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:00.199
What's wrong?

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:03.168
Everything's fine. Hey, drink my coffee.

00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:07.800
That's right, I need to talk my father right now!

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:10.875
What? Why the hell is he in Europe?!

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:12.945
For work?

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:14.881
But that's not the way I understood it!

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:16.940
This is urgent! I can't wait that...

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:20.811
Damn! That's not what I heard!
What the hell is going on?

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:35.097
Herve, it's almost time.

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.737
Anna, come over here.

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:40.570
No, I wanna stay here.

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:43.639
Anna, I'll be there later.

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:46.636
Mireille...

00:05:56.289 --> 00:05:58.189
You shouldn't see it either.

00:06:05.064 --> 00:06:06.258
She's in cardiac arrest.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:08.729
All right, go in.

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:14.340
Hey, wait a second!

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.641
What's that in your hand?!

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:17.343
Hey, what are you going to do with that?

00:06:17.343 --> 00:06:18.344
Stop it, Herve!

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:21.547
Dr. Bender, Mireille is still...
Mireille is still alive!

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:22.515
Don't do this!

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.183
There's nothing we can do now, Herve!

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:27.152
Let me go! What the hell?! Stop it!

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:31.824
There's no way that's right!

00:06:31.824 --> 00:06:33.159
Herve, calm down!
Don't give up on her!

00:06:33.159 --> 00:06:33.826
Don't give up on her!

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:34.427
Have you forgotten what happened
to your mother at the end?!
Don't give up on her!

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:36.062
Have you forgotten what happened
to your mother at the end?!

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:39.463
Mireille will no longer recognize you
and will start attacking you too!

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:43.828
Mireille...

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:48.074
Bender, go ahead.

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.302
Okay.

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:51.176
This is our destiny.

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:56.443
We cannot escape from the curse.

00:06:59.018 --> 00:07:01.687
This means that you chose not to do
anything about it, that's all.

00:07:01.687 --> 00:07:02.745
Herve...

00:07:05.358 --> 00:07:07.727
Don't you play dumb with me!
You're not going to fool me anymore!

00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:12.061
All of you have dreamed about this bullshit
experiment and given up on them!

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:20.139
No! No... No... No!

00:07:20.139 --> 00:07:21.307
Herve...
No! No... No... No!

00:07:21.307 --> 00:07:23.571
No! No... No... No!

00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:50.295
Herve?

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:55.235
What's the matter this late at night?

00:07:59.278 --> 00:08:02.907
Before I came here, I was...

00:08:04.183 --> 00:08:07.311
having so much fun.

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:14.116
I don't remember exactly, but I just know it.

00:08:15.027 --> 00:08:16.016
I see.

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:20.997
That day, I had so much fun.

00:08:21.868 --> 00:08:23.495
It was evening time.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.639
Hmm, where was that?

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:34.975
Coney Island, maybe?

00:08:35.381 --> 00:08:36.473
What?

00:08:36.983 --> 00:08:38.450
Remember the target shooting?

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:54.093
My memory is all mixed up, and...

00:08:54.634 --> 00:08:56.124
It's because of the medicine.

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:05.305
Herve...

00:09:06.412 --> 00:09:07.936
Was that you?

00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:09.575
Herve?

00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:13.716
Yeah, that's right, it was me.

00:09:15.521 --> 00:09:17.955
I'm the one who brought you here.

00:09:19.992 --> 00:09:24.292
Herve, so it was you after all.

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:32.136
I'm glad... I'm glad, Herve.

00:09:33.573 --> 00:09:36.838
It was you after all.

00:09:38.144 --> 00:09:41.375
I'm glad! I'm glad...

00:09:51.857 --> 00:09:53.051
You...

00:09:55.161 --> 00:09:57.152
You were a victim too.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.058
Herve... Herve...

00:10:05.304 --> 00:10:06.305
Hello?

00:10:06.305 --> 00:10:07.829
Hey, it's me.

00:10:09.408 --> 00:10:10.843
What's wrong?

00:10:10.843 --> 00:10:12.538
Can I see you tomorrow?

00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:15.539
Okay.

00:10:22.121 --> 00:10:24.089
Did something happen?

00:10:25.925 --> 00:10:27.119
Your cousin...

00:10:28.728 --> 00:10:30.992
Herve, what's the matter?

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:34.200
Herve?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:39.069
Actually, I saw you at night.

00:10:39.538 --> 00:10:40.505
Huh?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:45.604
Weren't you doing something with some guy?

00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:48.674
I was shocked.

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:51.745
What happened was...

00:10:53.252 --> 00:10:56.322
What happened was that the guy started
attacking me out of nowhere, and...

00:10:56.322 --> 00:10:57.556
Started attacking you, and?

00:10:57.556 --> 00:11:02.328
And, uh, I was just trying to
escape from him, and I...

00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:03.590
With a baseball bat?

00:11:05.297 --> 00:11:06.559
That's not true, is it?

00:11:07.867 --> 00:11:09.164
That was...

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.662
The baseball bat was...

00:11:13.305 --> 00:11:18.504
You choked the guy, then the little girl
with short hair beat him up, right?

00:11:20.546 --> 00:11:22.446
Until the guy stopped moving.

00:11:22.748 --> 00:11:25.351
You guys beat him to death, right?

00:11:25.351 --> 00:11:29.515
I was watching all four of you from
the beginning to the end.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:32.685
Does your sister know about that?

00:11:33.826 --> 00:11:35.157
Hey, Kate.

00:11:35.327 --> 00:11:36.453
What about your parents?

00:11:38.431 --> 00:11:41.559
Of course, you can't tell them
that you do stuff like that.

00:11:42.368 --> 00:11:45.599
If you don't want me to tell anyone about this,
you have to promise me.

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:50.200
Promise me that you'll never tell
anyone that I saw you.

00:11:51.744 --> 00:11:53.644
Okay? Understood?

00:11:58.451 --> 00:12:00.544
From where? Who's it from?!

00:12:00.986 --> 00:12:02.180
No idea...

00:12:02.588 --> 00:12:03.919
But why now?

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.692
It was dropped off directly without
coming through the post office.

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:09.528
Who did this? For what purpose? I have no idea.

00:12:09.528 --> 00:12:12.088
Hey! What the hell do you think you're doing?!

00:12:12.298 --> 00:12:13.966
Nothing, really.

00:12:13.966 --> 00:12:15.968
Don't give me that!

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:17.765
You know they've been calling you, right?

00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:22.374
In the 14th block, an old man has been
holding an old woman hostage!

00:12:22.374 --> 00:12:24.043
You said the 14th block and... what?

00:12:24.043 --> 00:12:27.570
If you get your asses in the car, you'll hear the
radio whether you like it or not! Now move it!

00:12:29.849 --> 00:12:30.816
Kate!

00:12:31.617 --> 00:12:33.141
What are you doing here?

00:12:33.786 --> 00:12:35.310
Hey, you don't look good.

00:12:37.923 --> 00:12:39.185
Well...

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.629
Can we all get together?

00:12:45.297 --> 00:12:46.264
What?

00:12:46.732 --> 00:12:49.223
We can call Rachel and Rose too.

00:12:49.702 --> 00:12:50.794
Yeah...

00:12:52.104 --> 00:12:55.130
Kate, can you come with me for a sec?

00:12:59.645 --> 00:13:01.237
This is it.

00:13:02.314 --> 00:13:04.077
Oh, this is...

00:13:04.316 --> 00:13:06.113
Of course you've seen it before, right?

00:13:07.153 --> 00:13:10.554
It's the diary Lise and I were keeping.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:15.151
This thing in Lise's diary...
It means her boyfriend, right?

00:13:17.096 --> 00:13:20.759
If that's the case, we were thinking that it could
possibly be Lise's boyfriend's house

00:13:21.233 --> 00:13:24.896
or the last place where she was taken by him.

00:13:25.871 --> 00:13:28.066
I wonder which place it's indicating?

00:13:28.607 --> 00:13:30.234
Tell us what you know.

00:13:39.752 --> 00:13:41.086
Hello?

00:13:41.086 --> 00:13:42.451
So, what did the police say?

00:13:46.525 --> 00:13:48.220
The police came to see you today, right?

00:13:50.029 --> 00:13:51.030
How do you...

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:55.057
What did the police ask you?
Tell me what you told them.

00:13:56.802 --> 00:13:59.965
They showed me the diary Lise
and I were keeping, and...

00:14:00.806 --> 00:14:05.607
Then, the location of the mansion which
is located outside town...

00:14:05.911 --> 00:14:07.845
Okay, I see.

00:14:09.114 --> 00:14:11.742
By the way, have you been keeping the
promise that you made with me?

00:14:12.418 --> 00:14:15.683
You haven't told anyone that
I know about it, have you?

00:14:16.488 --> 00:14:17.489
No...

00:14:17.489 --> 00:14:18.786
Then that's cool.

00:14:19.158 --> 00:14:20.625
I'll call you again.

00:14:22.161 --> 00:14:23.423
Is something up?

00:14:25.164 --> 00:14:30.158
I was gonna call Rachel and Rose,
but you never told me what it's about, so...

00:14:30.803 --> 00:14:33.237
Oh, that's... It's not a big deal.

00:14:33.572 --> 00:14:36.905
Since I haven't talked to you guys much lately,
I was just thinking it'd be nice to get together

00:14:37.076 --> 00:14:38.771
and go grab a bite to eat or something.

00:14:39.245 --> 00:14:41.577
Oh, okay. Wanna do it tonight?

00:14:41.947 --> 00:14:43.744
Do you have to work?

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:45.651
Yeah, but...

00:14:45.651 --> 00:14:47.052
Then it's okay!

00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:47.820
What?

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:48.220
Let's do it some other time.
What?

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.482
Let's do it some other time.

00:14:49.688 --> 00:14:51.747
Whenever it's convenient for
everyone, you know.

00:14:52.157 --> 00:14:53.459
Are you sure?

00:14:53.459 --> 00:14:54.426
Yeah...

00:14:55.427 --> 00:14:56.394
That's fine.

00:14:59.431 --> 00:15:01.901
The person Kate has been seeing?

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:04.631
Yes, I'm thinking about looking into that.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.038
Is it a man?

00:15:06.038 --> 00:15:08.404
Yes, he's older than her and he works.

00:15:08.707 --> 00:15:10.470
Is he her boyfriend?

00:15:10.709 --> 00:15:12.734
He seems to be something along
those lines at least.

00:15:13.245 --> 00:15:16.112
To think a person like that
has been seeing Kate...

00:15:16.649 --> 00:15:20.586
It's hard to imagine Kate has
been seeing an older man.

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:21.746
I know.

00:15:22.087 --> 00:15:25.420
So, he's at least worth looking into, you think?

00:15:25.624 --> 00:15:27.717
I can't say anything certain about him yet, but...

00:15:28.027 --> 00:15:31.861
Since there have been strange
activities lately anyway...

00:15:32.231 --> 00:15:33.866
What was that diary about?

00:15:33.866 --> 00:15:35.458
I just don't get it.

00:15:35.901 --> 00:15:38.734
At any rate, we can't be too careful.

00:15:40.539 --> 00:15:41.938
Please take care of it, okay?

00:15:43.409 --> 00:15:45.001
That man shouldn't be taken lightly.

00:15:45.911 --> 00:15:47.479
Okay, I'll keep my eye on him.

00:15:47.479 --> 00:15:49.548
But don't pursue him too far.

00:15:49.548 --> 00:15:50.515
I know.

00:15:52.518 --> 00:15:53.985
What's the meaning of this?

00:15:54.887 --> 00:15:57.185
They're all made by that
pharmaceutical company.

00:15:57.623 --> 00:16:01.354
They look new. It hasn't been that long
since they were placed here.

00:16:02.328 --> 00:16:03.693
Should we go in there?

00:16:07.132 --> 00:16:08.224
Hey, this is...

00:16:09.535 --> 00:16:10.502
Lise's...

00:16:10.936 --> 00:16:13.097
Looks like someone wants to talk, huh?

00:16:18.644 --> 00:16:21.738
I want to ask you something about
Kate and the other girls.

00:16:22.581 --> 00:16:23.980
I looked into it,

00:16:24.283 --> 00:16:27.820
and I noticed that Kate started being late
for class and absent from school often

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.380
around the same time as Rose,
Rachel and Claire.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:36.059
Right, it seems that everyone became a
little unstable after Lise's death.

00:16:36.428 --> 00:16:38.658
But don't you think there's something more to it?

00:16:40.265 --> 00:16:42.426
Maybe you do know the truth, Paula!

00:16:43.302 --> 00:16:47.136
Those people who came out of the school
president's office with you earlier...

00:16:47.973 --> 00:16:51.101
I saw Miss Lucy, but who are the other people?

00:16:53.045 --> 00:16:54.880
What does that have to do with it?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:56.815
I want to know too!

00:16:56.815 --> 00:16:59.385
Who are those people that you've been
seeing every now and then?

00:16:59.385 --> 00:17:04.584
Jessica, I admire your enthusiasm,
but that's outside of the Grace's role.

00:17:05.124 --> 00:17:05.858
But...

00:17:05.858 --> 00:17:06.258
You need to hold back a little!
But...

00:17:06.258 --> 00:17:07.088
You need to hold back a little!

00:17:10.396 --> 00:17:12.023
Since when have you been using subways?

00:17:13.632 --> 00:17:15.691
Recently, I use it sometimes.

00:17:16.168 --> 00:17:17.396
Why?

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:22.908
No particular reason, I guess.

00:17:22.908 --> 00:17:25.433
Have you been sort of avoiding us?

00:17:26.545 --> 00:17:28.012
Who is "us"?

00:17:28.914 --> 00:17:31.007
I mean everybody, all our friends.

00:17:31.316 --> 00:17:32.918
No, I haven't.

00:17:32.918 --> 00:17:33.552
Then why...

00:17:33.552 --> 00:17:38.421
There's nothing to it, it's just...
No particular reason.

00:17:39.558 --> 00:17:40.616
I see.

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.284
Right.

00:17:43.762 --> 00:17:44.696
You know...
Tonight...

00:17:44.696 --> 00:17:46.129
Tonight, what?

00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:50.836
Well, tonight do you wanna go somewhere?

00:17:50.836 --> 00:17:53.272
Tonight? That's perfect!

00:17:53.272 --> 00:17:58.005
We were just talking about going to Jim's party!
So, come with us, Rachel!

00:17:59.144 --> 00:18:01.078
Rachel, I'll come pick you up.

00:18:02.614 --> 00:18:03.774
Yeah...

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.910
Sorry, but I'll pass.

00:18:08.387 --> 00:18:11.356
What? Are you sure?

00:18:12.124 --> 00:18:13.386
Yeah...

00:18:17.162 --> 00:18:18.288
Excuse me...

00:18:20.866 --> 00:18:29.535
Um, I'm Robert Sheedy's daughter,
Rose Sheedy, and...

00:18:30.576 --> 00:18:33.704
Uh, in here, my father...

00:18:36.582 --> 00:18:37.616
Go there.

00:18:37.616 --> 00:18:38.851
Huh?

00:18:38.851 --> 00:18:40.085
I'll buy you a drink.

00:18:40.085 --> 00:18:42.076
N... No thank you!

00:18:45.591 --> 00:18:48.160
H... Hey, look! Check it out!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.025
Huh? What is it?

00:18:50.229 --> 00:18:51.897
Hey, that's Rachel and...

00:18:51.897 --> 00:18:53.232
Nick from the literature class!

00:18:53.232 --> 00:18:54.733
Oh my god, what's going on?

00:18:54.733 --> 00:18:56.835
Is this a "private lesson"?

00:18:56.835 --> 00:18:58.337
How hard-working!

00:18:58.337 --> 00:19:00.931
They see each other at night too, huh?

00:19:07.079 --> 00:19:11.345
I guess there is something
going on in this place.

00:19:17.289 --> 00:19:18.779
What the... You gotta be kidding me!

00:19:19.057 --> 00:19:20.792
Hey, what are you doing?

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:22.127
What happened to the business that was here?

00:19:22.127 --> 00:19:26.365
Huh? Oh, that company is done for.
Everyone probably "disappeared" themselves.

00:19:26.365 --> 00:19:28.162
Excuse me!

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.039
This must've been hammering that young CEO.

00:19:34.039 --> 00:19:38.043
Hey, do you know the staff here? Randy too?

00:19:38.043 --> 00:19:39.044
Randy?

00:19:39.044 --> 00:19:40.679
The CEO of this company.

00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:42.681
You know, he's still young and
his hair looks like this.

00:19:42.681 --> 00:19:45.548
Oh, yeah! This was a total disaster for him!

00:19:46.218 --> 00:19:49.087
I've heard that his friend who was also
his purchasing agent betrayed him.

00:19:49.087 --> 00:19:51.857
But the thing is that the guy didn't
think they were "friends."

00:19:51.857 --> 00:19:53.859
He basically made a sucker of him.

00:19:53.859 --> 00:19:55.194
What happened?

00:19:55.194 --> 00:19:56.895
Where is he now?

00:19:56.895 --> 00:19:58.263
Who knows?

00:19:58.263 --> 00:19:59.831
Hey, take that one over there!

00:19:59.831 --> 00:20:00.065
I bet it hit him hard mentally.

00:20:00.065 --> 00:20:01.733
Stop messing around! Get to work!
I bet it hit him hard mentally.

00:20:01.733 --> 00:20:02.367
Stop messing around! Get to work!

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:04.562
Really, I wonder what he's doing?

00:20:09.208 --> 00:20:12.075
I don't have it... I don't have it...
Where the hell is that old fart's address?

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:15.376
Office? This is it!

00:20:18.183 --> 00:20:21.084
Hello? This is Claire Forrest.
Is my father there?

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:25.953
Like I said, I'm Claire Forrest!
The daughter of the CEO!

00:20:27.226 --> 00:20:29.888
All right, I get it, just hurry up
and let me talk to him!

00:20:31.363 --> 00:20:32.489
Out of town?!

00:20:36.969 --> 00:20:38.493
What? What's up with Randy?

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.537
Suicide?

00:21:10.302 --> 00:21:13.271
You should eat something, Anna.

00:21:28.987 --> 00:21:31.423
My only love sprung from my only hate

00:21:31.423 --> 00:21:33.825
Too early seen unknown, and known too late

00:21:33.825 --> 00:21:38.762
Prodigious birth of love it is to me,
that I must love a loathed enemy

00:21:39.164 --> 00:21:41.600
Step by step, I lost track of time

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:44.169
And kept on dancing when I met you

00:21:44.169 --> 00:21:46.471
Without knowing the fate that lies in the stars

00:21:46.471 --> 00:21:49.007
I can't stop falling in love

00:21:49.007 --> 00:21:51.576
An unfaithful moon's lacking morals

00:21:51.576 --> 00:21:53.912
Give light to my full-on desire

00:21:53.912 --> 00:21:56.281
Grasping onto fate, I scream out

00:21:56.281 --> 00:21:58.850
"Wherefore art thou Juliet?"

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.647
Go ahead and laugh at it

00:22:01.153 --> 00:22:02.984
And call it stupid love

00:22:03.588 --> 00:22:05.556
Throw it all

00:22:06.058 --> 00:22:07.992
Because I'll be right there

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:11.094
Oh, my Juliet...

00:22:11.163 --> 00:22:15.534
Tell me God, what do I do

00:22:15.534 --> 00:22:20.767
To make my wishes come true?

00:22:21.139 --> 00:22:25.410
Ah! This is so painful

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:28.243
I howl into the night sky

00:22:29.681 --> 00:22:36.388
Does everyone go to sleep

00:22:36.388 --> 00:22:39.624
Holding onto a thought like this?

00:22:39.624 --> 00:22:43.929
Ah! Open your eyes right away

00:22:43.929 --> 00:22:46.765
Laugh at it if it's a joke

00:22:46.765 --> 00:22:49.199
Oh, my sweet Juliet

00:22:50.836 --> 00:22:53.305
You who's sleeping and I with no name

00:22:53.305 --> 00:22:54.806
Pelted by tragic rain

00:22:54.806 --> 00:22:56.467
Say good die

00:23:02.481 --> 00:23:05.279
Betrayal and rage...

00:23:05.984 --> 00:23:09.788
One little word erased a slight hope.

00:23:09.788 --> 00:23:11.423
Episode #16
Painful Lie
One little word erased a slight hope.

00:23:11.423 --> 00:23:14.517
Episode #16
Painful Lie
